# Repo-root ignores. Note src/fenics/.gitignore handles that subtree's own artefacts
# (results/, meshes, field dumps, GIFs); its rules are relative to that folder, so they
# do NOT cover anything here.

# The research team's raw k-Wave output. 423 MB across three runs, and every
# *_workspace.mat is ~122 MB - OVER GITHUB'S HARD 100 MB PER-FILE LIMIT, so a push
# carrying one is rejected outright, not merely slow. Re-obtain from the research team;
# tools/extract_kwave_case.py reduces each to a few-MB .npz under results/.
data/derrell/

# Their MAT dumps are never small; blanket rule so a stray copy elsewhere cannot slip in.
*.mat

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# OS / editor
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
